OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on historic bridge
OL,4,Arepairs after collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on repairs to a
OL,7,Fmedieval Worcestershire bridge, more
OL,8,Fthan two-and-a-half years after it
OL,9,Fsuffered a partial collapse.
OL,11,FPowick Old Bridge in Worcester has been
OL,12,Fclosed since parts of it were washed
OL,13,Faway in floods in January 2024.
OL,15,FWorcestershire County Council said
OL,16,F"advanced work" was taking place,
OL,17,Fincluding excavating behind the damaged
OL,18,Fsection of the bridge, before a
OL,19,Fpermanent repair programme starts in
OL,20,Fthe spring.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
