OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on historic bridge
OL,4,Arepairs after collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "Powick Old Bridge
OL,7,Fis one of Worcestershire's most
OL,8,Fsignificant heritage assets, and we are
OL,9,Fcommitted to ensuring its careful and
OL,10,Fsensitive restoration."
